==== Meltdown and Spectre ====
The AMD GX-412TC SoC is vulnerable to Meltdown and Spectre. For a detailed analysis and possible mitigations on the APU2, see [[https://blog.3mdeb.com/2019/2019-05-29-spectre-and-meltdown-on-apu2/|3mdeb blog post]]

